WEBVTT

00:16.340 --> 00:19.950
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:19.950 --> 00:23.620
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.580
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:30.960 --> 00:34.500
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.500 --> 00:38.170
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.170 --> 00:42.130
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.470 --> 00:52.710
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai</b>

00:52.710 --> 00:59.990
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

00:59.990 --> 01:03.660
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.660 --> 01:07.260
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.260 --> 01:14.540
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.540 --> 01:18.170
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.170 --> 01:24.910
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:24.910 --> 01:28.680
<b>Let it go, Shinjiyou</b>

01:30.620 --> 01:32.120
<b>A rumor?</b>

01:32.120 --> 01:34.790
<b>Yes, over the past few weeks,</b>

01:34.790 --> 01:38.030
<b>we've heard almost the same rumor
coming from different places.</b>

01:38.030 --> 01:43.800
<b>The fact is, according to the rumors,
thirty demons have disappeared,</b>

01:43.800 --> 01:47.700
<b>and just the other day,
eight vanished overnight.</b>

01:47.700 --> 01:49.170
<b>Eight overnight?!</b>

01:52.940 --> 01:54.970
<b>And what's this rumor?</b>

02:12.990 --> 02:14.460
<b>Help!</b>

02:21.970 --> 02:24.500
<b>Don't look so sad.</b>

02:25.640 --> 02:28.870
<b>The weak have no right to live.</b>

02:29.640 --> 02:31.110
<b>You know that, don't you?</b>

02:36.720 --> 02:38.520
<b>She's a real fine one.</b>

02:40.620 --> 02:42.290
<b>She's got nice legs.</b>

02:42.290 --> 02:46.280
<b>Not just her legs, the curve from
her shoulders to her neck...</b>

02:53.470 --> 02:54.940
<b>Hey!</b>

03:06.450 --> 03:08.180
<b>So what does this mean?</b>

03:09.850 --> 03:13.050
<b>Lord Kougaiji, I'll go
investigate this matter.</b>

03:13.050 --> 03:14.190
<b>No!</b>

03:14.190 --> 03:16.830
<b>Here we go again, Kougaiji's
over-protectiveness.</b>

03:16.830 --> 03:18.550
<b>You never change, do you, brother?</b>

03:20.300 --> 03:21.800
<b>I'm not...</b>

03:21.800 --> 03:25.170
<b>At any rate, someone
must look into this.</b>

03:25.170 --> 03:27.630
<b>I believe I'm most suited for
information gathering.</b>

03:30.040 --> 03:31.810
<b>Scout it out, but that's it!</b>

03:31.810 --> 03:33.610
<b>Come back right away when
you find the cause!</b>

03:33.610 --> 03:36.440
<b>Your priority is to report back to me!</b>

03:36.440 --> 03:37.710
<b>Yes, My Lord.</b>

03:37.710 --> 03:39.180
<b>Good grief.</b>

03:43.290 --> 03:46.420
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!</b>

03:46.420 --> 03:48.820
<b>Aren't we there yet, Hakkai?</b>

03:48.820 --> 03:52.860
<b>Please bear with it. The town should
be coming into view soon.</b>

03:52.860 --> 03:57.470
<b>You keep on saying, soon, soon!
I'm gonna turn into jerky at this rate!</b>

03:57.470 --> 04:00.370
<b>And I'll bet no one would
buy monkey jerky.</b>

04:01.540 --> 04:02.340
<b>What did you say?!</b>

04:02.340 --> 04:06.240
<b>But how long are we going to be
stuck with this kind of scenery?</b>

04:06.240 --> 04:09.140
<b>Just sky and ground as far
as the eye can see.</b>

04:12.780 --> 04:14.250
<b>What the heck is that?</b>

04:19.120 --> 04:22.920
<b>Well, well, how diligent of them
in this stinking hot weather.</b>

04:22.920 --> 04:25.390
<b>Hey, Sanzo, what're they doing?</b>

04:25.390 --> 04:26.860
<b>How would I know?</b>

04:27.660 --> 04:29.400
<b>Who the hell are these guys anyway?</b>

04:29.400 --> 04:32.090
<b>They're a sorry-looking bunch.</b>

04:32.700 --> 04:36.170
<b>They're the Special Anti-Demon
Unit, Huanglong.</b>

04:36.170 --> 04:37.870
<b>Huanglong?</b>

04:37.870 --> 04:41.360
<b>A private army that specializes
in fighting demons.</b>

04:42.540 --> 04:47.240
<b>Well, I suppose they're more like
bounty hunters than an army.</b>

04:47.780 --> 04:49.990
<b>The purpose for which they
were formed seems to be</b>

04:49.990 --> 04:53.920
<b>to take requests from towns and
villages to fight demons.</b>

04:56.090 --> 04:57.590
<b>Come on, let's go.</b>

04:57.590 --> 04:59.190
<b>They've got nothing to do with us.</b>

04:59.190 --> 05:00.760
<b>We're just wasting our time here.</b>

05:00.760 --> 05:02.230
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

05:02.230 --> 05:04.220
<b>Hey, Hakkai, Gojyo!</b>

05:07.170 --> 05:07.840
<b>Who's that?</b>

05:07.840 --> 05:11.870
<b>Don't know. I've got no friends
among the likes of them.</b>

05:12.470 --> 05:13.980
<b>It's me! Me!</b>

05:13.980 --> 05:16.500
<b>We used to live in the same
town, remember?</b>

05:17.510 --> 05:20.320
<b>Tongpu! It's you!</b>

05:20.320 --> 05:22.220
<b>That's right.</b>

05:22.220 --> 05:26.020
<b>Oh, Tongpu! You used to be a house
player at a mah-jong parlor!</b>

05:26.020 --> 05:28.820
<b>Yeah, I'm glad you remembered me.</b>

05:31.590 --> 05:35.760
<b>So Tongpu, what're you doing here?</b>

05:35.760 --> 05:40.800
<b>Well, I wasn't about to be stuck
in the boondocks forever.</b>

05:40.800 --> 05:42.600
<b>Yeah, I get you.</b>

05:42.600 --> 05:45.800
<b>I want to set the chaos
in this world straight.</b>

05:46.780 --> 05:50.250
<b>So anyway, I signed up
to join Huanglong.</b>

05:50.250 --> 05:52.610
<b>Well, I just got in recently though.</b>

05:53.920 --> 05:55.820
<b>Tongpu, get back in line!</b>

05:55.820 --> 05:57.280
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

06:00.190 --> 06:02.860
<b>Hey, I'm sure we've got a lot
of catching up to do,</b>

06:02.860 --> 06:05.190
<b>so you wanna get together
properly tomorrow?</b>

06:05.190 --> 06:07.160
<b>I can get some time off
if it's tomorrow!</b>

06:07.930 --> 06:09.930
<b>Properly?</b>

06:09.930 --> 06:13.370
<b>I know a bar in the town up ahead
that has good local sake!</b>

06:13.970 --> 06:15.530
<b>Oh, all right then.</b>

06:16.740 --> 06:18.370
<b>Then I'll see you tomorrow!</b>

06:18.370 --> 06:19.840
<b>Sure!</b>

06:24.550 --> 06:28.020
<b>Huanglong? It's not a very
cool-sounding name.</b>

06:28.020 --> 06:30.750
<b>But he sure hasn't changed at all.</b>

06:31.650 --> 06:32.850
<b>Right, Hakkai?</b>

06:32.850 --> 06:35.060
<b>Do you think so?</b>

06:35.060 --> 06:39.360
<b>He never seemed to me like the type
to join that sort of group.</b>

06:39.930 --> 06:41.800
<b>I don't think it's a bad thing.</b>

06:41.800 --> 06:46.530
<b>It's an admirable ambition,
even if it's a bit stuffy.</b>

06:48.300 --> 06:50.240
<b>Do you think so?</b>

06:50.240 --> 06:54.400
<b>It just means humans aren't
taking it lying down either.</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:15.800
<b>This must be it.</b>

07:35.950 --> 07:38.040
<b>How do you like the view?</b>

07:39.550 --> 07:44.050
<b>You've got some guts coming here
by yourself, Miss Demon.</b>

07:44.630 --> 07:48.390
<b>But you didn't take us quite as
seriously as you should have.</b>

07:51.270 --> 07:56.970
<b>Well, maybe it's the best you could do
with the intelligence of a demon.</b>

07:57.310 --> 08:01.210
<b>So you ARE the people who've
been killing demons.</b>

08:01.210 --> 08:06.480
<b>That's right. We never go hungry,
thanks to you stupid demons.</b>

08:08.920 --> 08:11.280
<b>I won't let you get away with it!</b>

08:12.320 --> 08:13.790
<b>Get her!</b>

08:28.700 --> 08:30.170
<b>Oh, no!</b>

08:58.630 --> 09:00.160
<b>Awake, are we?</b>

09:01.340 --> 09:02.800
<b>You bast...</b>

09:04.310 --> 09:06.170
<b>Serves you right.</b>

09:06.170 --> 09:08.230
<b>You can struggle there all you want.</b>

09:09.540 --> 09:12.550
<b>Now talk! Who the hell are you?!</b>

09:12.550 --> 09:15.180
<b>I know you're not just any demon!</b>

09:20.420 --> 09:24.530
<b>Fine, then. There's plenty of time.</b>

09:24.530 --> 09:27.860
<b>We'll interrogate you thoroughly later.</b>

09:31.630 --> 09:33.100
<b>Lord Kougaiji...</b>

09:34.140 --> 09:37.910
<b>She's late! It's way past time
for her to report back!</b>

09:37.910 --> 09:40.840
<b>Brother, something must've
happened to Yaone!</b>

09:42.810 --> 09:44.240
<b>Kou!</b>

09:47.720 --> 09:50.120
<b>Dokugakuji, bring a flight
dragon out front!</b>

09:52.090 --> 09:56.420
<b>Well then, in celebration of a
memorable reunion, cheers.</b>

09:56.420 --> 09:57.890
<b>Cheers!</b>

10:01.700 --> 10:04.360
<b>This looks good! I'm digging in!</b>

10:05.070 --> 10:06.690
<b>It's been three years, hasn't it?</b>

10:07.940 --> 10:09.470
<b>So, how're you doing, Tongpu?</b>

10:09.470 --> 10:11.970
<b>Playing the proper champion
of justice?</b>

10:11.970 --> 10:13.940
<b>I don't have any actual
combat experience yet.</b>

10:13.940 --> 10:17.080
<b>Instead, I get the intensive training
from Hell everyday.</b>

10:17.080 --> 10:18.780
<b>It must be tough.</b>

10:18.780 --> 10:20.920
<b>There are some demons out there</b>

10:20.920 --> 10:24.320
<b>that humans don't stand a chance
against, aren't there?</b>

10:24.320 --> 10:25.810
<b>That's what our training's for.</b>

10:26.790 --> 10:28.260
<b>Besides...</b>

10:29.060 --> 10:32.290
<b>It looks like the higher-ups are getting
something awesome ready.</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:35.360
<b>A secret weapon, so to speak.</b>

10:35.360 --> 10:37.060
<b>A secret weapon?</b>

10:38.130 --> 10:41.470
<b>We're definitely getting into more
battles with demons lately.</b>

10:41.470 --> 10:46.510
<b>As a matter of fact, a demon
attacked our camp yesterday.</b>

10:46.510 --> 10:50.510
<b>It was a pretty good-loking demon,</b>

10:50.510 --> 10:52.810
<b>but what's amazing is that
she came all alone.</b>

10:52.810 --> 10:54.180
<b>Alone?</b>

10:54.180 --> 10:57.650
<b>Yeah, it was a demon who
used spears and bombs.</b>

10:57.650 --> 11:00.690
<b>She sure gave us a hard time.</b>

11:00.690 --> 11:02.590
<b>Spears and bombs?</b>

11:05.930 --> 11:07.530
<b>What's wrong?</b>

11:07.530 --> 11:11.500
<b>Nothing, I was just wondering
what happened to that demon.</b>

11:11.500 --> 11:15.540
<b>Oh, I think she was captured alive
and incarcerated somewhere.</b>

11:15.540 --> 11:17.610
<b>Is something wrong with that?
Is something wrong with that?</b>

11:17.610 --> 11:20.310
<b>You just sit there and eat octopus
for the rest of your life.</b>

11:20.310 --> 11:21.780
<b>What did you say, you bastard?!</b>

11:22.040 --> 11:23.540
<b>Let's get going soon.</b>

11:23.540 --> 11:25.950
<b>Oh, wait for me, Sanzo!</b>

11:25.950 --> 11:27.880
<b>Sorry about that, Tongpu.</b>

11:27.880 --> 11:30.120
<b>Oh, see you then.</b>

11:30.120 --> 11:32.350
<b>You're still gonna be in town
for a while, right?</b>

11:32.350 --> 11:34.510
<b>Yeah, I'll see you around.</b>

11:40.360 --> 11:41.830
<b>Yaone, right?</b>

11:42.660 --> 11:44.400
<b>Undoubtedly.</b>

11:44.400 --> 11:46.930
<b>What? Really?!</b>

11:46.930 --> 11:50.070
<b>Moron, you should notice
these things right away!</b>

11:50.070 --> 11:53.210
<b>I can't help it! I just didn't notice!</b>

11:53.210 --> 11:55.310
<b>That's why you're a monkey!</b>

11:55.310 --> 11:57.070
<b>What's that supposed to mean?!</b>

11:59.480 --> 12:00.950
<b>You're going?</b>

12:02.420 --> 12:06.380
<b>If you mess up, you might end up
having to fight that guy.</b>

12:09.660 --> 12:11.180
<b>I honestly don't know.</b>

12:13.290 --> 12:16.200
<b>Strictly speaking, Miss Yaone
is our enemy,</b>

12:16.200 --> 12:19.720
<b>and perhaps it isn't my place
to get involved in this.</b>

12:22.570 --> 12:24.040
<b>But...</b>

12:24.870 --> 12:28.040
<b>I just can't go on to the next village
without doing anything.</b>

12:29.140 --> 12:32.810
<b>Besides, it isn't as if I know for certain
I'll be fighting Tongpu.</b>

12:33.750 --> 12:34.520
<b>So...</b>

12:34.520 --> 12:36.810
<b>You want us to come with you, right?</b>

12:38.050 --> 12:39.520
<b>Right, Hakkai?</b>

12:41.820 --> 12:43.060
<b>Right!</b>

12:43.060 --> 12:46.530
<b>All right, now that that's decided,
let's hurry up and raid their camp!</b>

12:46.530 --> 12:47.990
<b>Wait.</b>

12:49.360 --> 12:50.850
<b>Sanzo...</b>

12:52.870 --> 12:54.800
<b>We'd do better to sneak in at night.</b>

12:55.370 --> 12:59.000
<b>After all, we've got two conspicuous
idiots with us.</b>

13:00.270 --> 13:02.010
<b>All right.</b>

13:02.010 --> 13:04.380
<b>He called you an idiot, you idiot.</b>

13:04.380 --> 13:06.310
<b>What'd you say, you bastard?!</b>

13:06.310 --> 13:08.920
<b>Wait, what'd you mean by
TWO idiots, Sanzo?!</b>

13:08.920 --> 13:10.380
<b>Exactly what it sounds like.</b>

13:16.720 --> 13:19.090
<b>It looks like this is definitely the place.</b>

13:20.030 --> 13:22.500
<b>Quite a large-scale operation
they have here.</b>

13:22.500 --> 13:25.500
<b>Maybe it's a bit too big
to find one person in?</b>

13:25.500 --> 13:26.870
<b>Hey, what're we going to do?</b>

13:26.870 --> 13:28.870
<b>Let's split up and search for her.</b>

13:28.870 --> 13:31.240
<b>We'll stand out if we move along
as a group.</b>

13:31.240 --> 13:33.670
<b>Okay, I'll see you guys later then.</b>

13:35.940 --> 13:36.940
<b>Shoot!</b>

13:36.940 --> 13:38.410
<b>Who's there?!</b>

13:41.320 --> 13:48.260
<b>Hey, monkey, we came here
to sneak in, not barge in.</b>

13:48.260 --> 13:50.260
<b>Do you get that?</b>

13:50.260 --> 13:51.960
<b>I know that!</b>

13:51.960 --> 13:53.830
<b>Nope, don't think you do.</b>

13:53.830 --> 13:55.760
<b>I don't wanna hear it from
a pervy water spite!</b>

13:58.630 --> 14:00.100
<b>Hakkai?</b>

14:03.000 --> 14:04.470
<b>Tongpu...</b>

14:05.410 --> 14:07.700
<b>What're you doing here?</b>

14:08.340 --> 14:09.780
<b>Well, I...</b>

14:11.650 --> 14:13.140
<b>You're not here to...</b>

14:21.860 --> 14:24.380
<b>I'm sorry. I have to hurry.</b>

14:36.500 --> 14:37.970
<b>Yaone!</b>

14:52.050 --> 14:54.920
<b>Kou, be careful! These guys
aren't half bad!</b>

14:56.260 --> 14:58.090
<b>Yaone!</b>

15:04.530 --> 15:06.760
<b>Why are you...</b>

15:08.070 --> 15:11.370
<b>We can talk later, but first,
let's get out of here.</b>

15:16.210 --> 15:17.950
<b>This is...</b>

15:17.950 --> 15:19.410
<b>It's awful.</b>

15:23.650 --> 15:25.190
<b>Kougaiji!</b>

15:25.190 --> 15:26.650
<b>What?!</b>

15:32.360 --> 15:34.330
<b>Where's Yaone?</b>

15:34.330 --> 15:36.020
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

15:36.660 --> 15:40.330
<b>If you don't know, then
I've got no use for you.</b>

15:41.100 --> 15:42.570
<b>Miss Yaone is right here.</b>

15:47.710 --> 15:49.010
<b>You guys are...</b>

15:49.010 --> 15:50.910
<b>Yaone!</b>

15:50.910 --> 15:54.650
<b>Kougaiji, you came here for Yaone.</b>

15:54.650 --> 15:55.980
<b>Genjo Sanzo!</b>

15:55.980 --> 15:58.250
<b>Oh, the droopy-eyed monkey!</b>

15:58.250 --> 16:01.780
<b>Just take Yaone! The fight's
already as good as over!</b>

16:03.160 --> 16:06.060
<b>We seem cursed to constantly
run into each other.</b>

16:06.060 --> 16:09.000
<b>Very well! Then hand over Yaone!</b>

16:10.100 --> 16:13.120
<b>All right, I'll go over there now.</b>

16:25.380 --> 16:26.850
<b>Tongpu...</b>

16:29.550 --> 16:31.150
<b>It's your fault!</b>

16:31.150 --> 16:34.120
<b>Tongpu, you bastard!</b>

16:34.120 --> 16:35.090
<b>You're dead meat!</b>

16:35.090 --> 16:36.560
<b>It's all right.</b>

16:37.390 --> 16:38.860
<b>Hakkai?</b>

16:39.630 --> 16:41.090
<b>Tongpu...</b>

16:42.430 --> 16:45.700
<b>What the hell's wrong with you guys?!
Helping demons?!</b>

16:46.600 --> 16:49.000
<b>Whose... Whose side are you on?!</b>

16:51.010 --> 16:53.240
<b>We're not on either side.</b>

16:54.380 --> 16:55.980
<b>But...</b>

16:55.980 --> 16:59.500
<b>I just did what I did because
I felt I wanted to.</b>

17:03.520 --> 17:05.020
<b>Hakkai!</b>

17:05.020 --> 17:09.480
<b>Kougaiji, we've returned
Miss Yaone to you.</b>

17:10.620 --> 17:12.090
<b>Yeah...</b>

17:21.370 --> 17:23.740
<b>Do you know that one who's
been bathed in the blood</b>

17:23.740 --> 17:26.640
<b>of a thousand demons transforms
into a demon?!</b>

17:27.340 --> 17:29.840
<b>Bathe in the blood of a thousand
demons, no matter how puny,</b>

17:29.840 --> 17:31.510
<b>and this is what you get!</b>

17:33.250 --> 17:34.710
<b>Say your prayers!</b>

17:35.680 --> 17:36.820
<b>Monster!</b>

17:36.820 --> 17:38.790
<b>Who's the demon here?!</b>

17:38.790 --> 17:43.160
<b>You have only yourselves to curse
for being too soft to finish me!</b>

17:43.160 --> 17:45.490
<b>You're all going to Hell together now!</b>

17:50.460 --> 17:51.930
<b>He's gone berserk.</b>

17:52.600 --> 17:54.470
<b>Goku, Gojyo, let's go!</b>

17:54.470 --> 17:58.470
<b>You guys stand back.
We'll take care of this.</b>

17:58.470 --> 18:00.470
<b>What do you intend to do?</b>

18:00.470 --> 18:02.840
<b>I mean to repay the debt.</b>

18:03.580 --> 18:04.850
<b>You gotta be joking!</b>

18:04.050 --> 18:07.210
<b>We've got way too much
energy for that!</b>

18:14.590 --> 18:16.060
<b>Melting stuff?!</b>

18:22.600 --> 18:24.170
<b>Damn it!</b>

18:24.170 --> 18:26.000
<b>Don't let down your guard, Monkey!</b>

18:26.000 --> 18:28.300
<b>That's why we told you
to leave it to us!</b>

18:28.300 --> 18:30.770
<b>Little Lirin Kick!</b>

18:44.450 --> 18:46.350
<b>Hakkai...</b>

18:46.350 --> 18:48.320
<b>Why did you...</b>

18:48.320 --> 18:52.550
<b>I told you, didn't I?
I'm not on either side.</b>

18:53.230 --> 18:57.460
<b>Besides, it seems you were kind
enough to miss anything vital.</b>

18:59.600 --> 19:02.090
<b>Now, shall we settle this?</b>

19:09.310 --> 19:10.880
<b>Hakkai!</b>

19:10.880 --> 19:12.810
<b>Please return to the darkness now.</b>

19:13.480 --> 19:17.210
<b>With all the souls of the
demons you killed!</b>

19:31.730 --> 19:33.670
<b>That should do it.</b>

19:33.670 --> 19:35.660
<b>It should be completely healed
by next week.</b>

19:36.400 --> 19:38.070
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

19:38.070 --> 19:39.910
<b>Not at all.</b>

19:39.910 --> 19:43.580
<b>I'll thank you for what happened today,
but the next time we meet...</b>

19:43.580 --> 19:47.010
<b>We know, we know, we're tired of
hearing you say that already.</b>

19:47.010 --> 19:50.020
<b>It wouldn't be fun to fight
in this situation anyway.</b>

19:50.020 --> 19:51.820
<b>Exactly.</b>

19:51.820 --> 19:55.360
<b>Hey, droopy-eyes, you better be
prepared for the next time we meet!</b>

19:55.360 --> 19:57.350
<b>Hurry up and go home, brat!</b>

19:58.990 --> 20:00.690
<b>Yaone, we're going home!</b>

20:01.930 --> 20:04.020
<b>Thank you, Mr. Hakkai.</b>

20:05.730 --> 20:07.200
<b>Miss Yaone...</b>

20:10.700 --> 20:12.190
<b>Come on, let's go!</b>

20:16.010 --> 20:18.710
<b>Who your enemies are and
who your friends are</b>

20:18.710 --> 20:21.380
<b>isn't something others should be
teaching you,</b>

20:21.380 --> 20:23.610
<b>much less deciding for you.</b>

20:25.620 --> 20:28.050
<b>Those are things you have
to decide for yourself.</b>

20:31.390 --> 20:32.860
<b>Right?</b>

20:39.400 --> 20:45.810
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:45.810 --> 20:51.180
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:51.180 --> 20:56.650
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

20:56.650 --> 21:00.050
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

21:00.050 --> 21:05.860
<b>Donna arifureta shiin mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:05.860 --> 21:11.300
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:11.300 --> 21:16.640
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:16.640 --> 21:20.540
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:27.550 --> 21:31.220
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:31.220 --> 21:33.150
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:33.150 --> 21:37.290
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:37.290 --> 21:41.430
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:41.430 --> 21:44.100
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:44.100 --> 21:49.140
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de</b>

21:49.140 --> 21:54.580
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:54.580 --> 21:59.980
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo onaji koto darou</b>

21:59.980 --> 22:04.040
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
